                                                                  2237 1451
  Updates of energy-angular distributions related to the emitted  2237 1451
  charged particles ( AUG. 2023)                                  2237 1451
                                                                  2237 1451
  H.I. Kim (KAERI),                                               2237 1451
  H.Y. Lee, T. Kawano, S.A. Kuvin, and M.W. Herman (LANL)         2237 1451
                                                                  2237 1451
  Energy-angular distributions of discrete and continuum levels   2237 1451
  and photon transitions related to emitted charged particles     2237 1451
  (proton, deuteron, triton, helium-3 and alpha)                  2237 1451
  have been updated [1] using CoH3 [2] and formatted into         2237 1451
  the ENDF-6 format using DeCE [3]. The Q-values have been        2237 1451
  calculated using the mass data in Audi's 2012 mass table [4]    2237 1451
  and FRDM2012 massess [5].                                       2237 1451
                                                                  2237 1451
  Summary of updated MF/MT                                        2237 1451
  MF=6  MT= 104, 105, 106 were deleted.                           2237 1451
  MF=3  MT= 600-608, 649, 650-659, 699, 700-709, 749, 750,        2237 1451
            800-809, 849 were added.                              2237 1451
  MF=6  MT= 600-608, 649, 650-659, 699, 700-709, 749, 750,        2237 1451
            800-809, 849 were added.                              2237 1451
                                                                  2237 1451
***********                                                       2237 1451
